WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.880
The Eagles’ recording history spans their debut, the Hotel California years and a reunion release that mixed live performances with new songs.

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:13.200
1972. The Eagles release their debut album.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:17.520
1976. Hotel California is released.

00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:23.560
1994. Hell Freezes Over brings reunion recordings and new songs together.

00:00:23.560 --> 00:00:29.000
The full timeline separates studio albums, live recordings and collections.
